/><zone xml:id="m-9dca7bae-1c1d-4dc1-a4f1-4f739d781525" ulx="94" uly="745" lrx="921" lry="784" /><zone xml:id="m-44496287-d634-4a46-8aaa-71d06d84ccc0" ulx="54" uly="772" lrx="922" lry="809" /><zone xml:id="m-0f00ccf4-70b5-41d3-b44c-716110ffe245" ulx="53" uly="801" lrx="921" lry="834" /><zone xml:id="m-39ac414c-3325-4420-9ad4-2ef5bfdf0761" ulx="53" uly="826" lrx="919" lry="864" /><zone xml:id="m-d52c9ece-790c-46ac-b2a5-7498527266cb" ulx="74" uly="857" lrx="603" lry="898" /><zone xml:id="m-70fad71c-77a1-42b0-bf26-67d5842de643" ulx="430" uly="896" lrx="541" lry="931" /><zone xml:id="m-6e879d27-ed8f-4bb7-b890-25c44fc24031" ulx="85" uly="929" lrx="918" lry="964" /><zone xml:id="m-9c5a5937-7d17-41c2-93c7-2cd431f84e47" ulx="59" uly="955" lrx="920" lry="995" /><zone xml:id="m-5c90f7d9-2ff8-4647-8f72-f5e3d5e53b06" ulx="52" uly="986" lrx="577" lry="1019" /><zone xml:id="m-8f36a0b1-ed22-4f60-878c-e1efaeadf33d" ulx="76" uly="1015" lrx="868" lry="1053" /><zone xml:id="m-374c76d3-c334-4abd-9fa5-83378d6a5c32" ulx="53" uly="1096" lrx="920" lry="1141" /><zone xml:id="m-93ca77d7-85c3-40ce-a360-a3e3167c1921" ulx="79" uly="1145" lrx="623" lry="1181" /><zone xml:id="m-44a275fb-55e5-40aa-a546-92ec052a2233" ulx="431" uly="1181" lrx="542" lry="1211" /><zone xml:id="m-80ae1ced-114d-4aa6-9937-73bd13791c2c" ulx="94" uly="1210" lrx="919" lry="1249" /><zone xml:id="m-561b82bb-f2e8-4938-a961-893e7a3f9d89" ulx="55" uly="1240" lrx="917" lry="1279" /><zone xml:id="m-4e915bc5-841f-447d-8ed1-99a1127ff71b" ulx="53" uly="1268" lrx="681" lry="1303" /><zone xml:id="m-0b937e21-de36-4687-abe8-43b08800708d" ulx="55" uly="1294" lrx="490" lry="1331" /><zone xml:id="m-65631cb0-500c-46d6-bb60-f16e494b0d6b" ulx="77" uly="1328" lrx="610" lry="1363" /><zone xml:id="m-634317a3-651a-4bf0-bff2-806983f7a257" ulx="75" uly="1360" lrx="769" lry="1396" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-6929f178-c147-4b7c-9adf-e972546335a2" n="1679" facs="#m-e6b0f6f0-7235-4d0c-845e-48a80cf51c80" /><div xml:id="m-9312bcb6-c174-48f2-b797-f5e0019e35c6">
            <lg xml:id="m-6cd53346-cad1-4337-ad7e-651e3559e567">
              <l xml:id="m-222a44e9-bed0-4083-8191-3ff702647bc9" facs="#m-00ec438e-93ea-4475-9855-1553100223ee" label="ambiguous">1n</l><l xml:id="m-30d5371b-0232-4f2f-a33a-014e08405309" facs="#m-1a7c92cf-04c7-4fdc-9b57-55ddd57e7a5c" label="ambiguous">May 19. 20.</l><l xml:id="m-bfa95514-f7e1-4256-936d-446984d3e061" facs="#m-0e730f64-3000-4107-ad5a-bad7ae37f250" label="text-like">Mass. Protexisti. p. 1146, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-7e0ab924-8140-4a37-92d7-88a335169a69" facs="#m-a02f6aa4-2f40-4915-8933-19c35010c40c" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-ad3d6911-c0a0-40a9-b97d-b33d52ebca16" facs="#m-9357fc20-114f-4af6-9ff2-a3c1aaeaf700" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui hunc diem beáti Venán-] et praesta; ut qui ejus mérita vene¬</l><l xml:id="m-d383adc9-baac-4764-b964-22d33fb6e314" facs="#m-39b85509-dd3c-4c59-a2b2-3b12c17a7011" label="lyrics-like">U tii Martyris tui triúmpho conse-lrámur, ei constántiam imité¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0f3f53a-34ba-4f2c-b3ff-90688a4c4b18" facs="#m-7882d8fa-68d1-4c5a-be29-389b9df31594" label="lyrics-like">crásti :t exáudi preces pópuli tui,  mur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5773a628-74ec-4ba3-8097-2b029bca8400" facs="#m-df1de9eb-d1e7-4319-9d84-92ba56dd722b" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-1a19cc21-d7c4-4ffc-9463-47dafefd5e7b" facs="#m-268a8996-2e28-4cb4-b4f3-b0db709c6ee6" label="lyrics-like">Anc oblatiónem, omnípotens diis adjúti, glóriae ejus consórte¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f310845-0a2c-41a2-8bbc-5b4c3b7edf9e" facs="#m-ab7c1b34-a829-4b73-9872-b25f32c80c94" label="lyrics-like">L Deus, beáti Venántii mérita tibi l efficiamur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e52ef764-ed8b-49d1-bd38-43b6caa2b18c" facs="#m-e6494016-7a62-483a-9147-633fa1ff53de" label="lyrics-like">reddant accéptam: ut ipsius subsí¬</l><l xml:id="m-a1854086-c350-420a-8930-823f929f109d" facs="#m-309c9a1f-1d18-4225-879b-58f64f3f25a7" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-4a2052be-dbf4-45fe-a9a7-1b3a73eff01e" facs="#m-2a59e5c9-47a8-4f13-987d-7f8053052409" label="lyrics-like">NUmpsimus, Dómine, aetérnae! Mártyre tuo pro nobis deprecánte,</l><l xml:id="m-80c8f4af-45ad-4517-9b26-4a4b02338d91" facs="#m-ba6f3c6e-6d68-4410-a75a-d515ef302b8a" label="lyrics-like">O vitãe sacraménta, te humiliter! véniam nobis concilient, et grátiam.</l><l xml:id="m-889610c2-a9b0-41db-af03-19b288a1d7ba" facs="#m-8daf42c4-8814-4a82-8057-c6f928c30716" label="lyrics-like">deprecántes: ut beáto Venántio! Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d9dd3a00-ed72-46d7-b0e7-15b303e2398e" facs="#m-0c16361f-c2e8-4740-b833-26ca2d1286c5" label="lyrics-like">7 Out of Paschal Time. Mass In virtúte túa. p. 1135, with the above</l><l xml:id="m-717ef7d1-e665-4361-8982-4e299b344888" facs="#m-7c2a4a3e-d7b7-41a5-8240-177a3fc5f5c0" label="text-like">Collect, Secret, and Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-af415838-8a92-43ad-8dec-4fa8c79bf9c9" facs="#m-cc6738ab-ca5f-42b7-94d5-aa3791053d9a" label="text-like">19. St. Peter Celestine, Pope and Confessor. Double.</l><l xml:id="m-7702f229-56d0-43f7-8df3-e92879dc2c2a" facs="#m-e147637a-414b-4175-a977-89bb4ed12be6" label="text-like">Mass. Si diligis me. of Hoty Popes, p. 11221.</l><l xml:id="m-911eca95-c4fb-4915-ac90-777f9fa22508" facs="#m-d952caf2-cb8a-4de7-b0d5-566b8fd64d9d" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-a4d94693-f45f-4b96-be67-6c2c574d4abe" facs="#m-9dca7bae-1c1d-4dc1-a4f1-4f739d781525" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Petrum Caele-l céde propítius; ut ejus exémplo cun¬</l><l xml:id="m-6013b2d2-bcb5-427d-ac38-a8b54e984c7b" facs="#m-44496287-d634-4a46-8aaa-71d06d84ccc0" label="lyrics-like">U stínum ad summi pontificátus! cta mundi despicere, * et ad pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f82a572-3978-4869-b01a-802f788d8453" facs="#m-0f00ccf4-70b5-41d3-b44c-716110ffe245" label="lyrics-like">ápicem sublimásti, quique illum hu-] missa humilibus praémia pervenire</l><l xml:id="m-659e1451-705d-4151-94da-f42f7f1d36ec" facs="#m-39ac414c-3325-4420-9ad4-2ef5bfdf0761" label="lyrics-like">militáti postpónere docuisti :f con-l feliciter mereámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c5eeb227-4729-4713-955c-c68b45c4f674" facs="#m-d52c9ece-790c-46ac-b2a5-7498527266cb" label="text-like">Commemoration or S. Pudentiana, Virgin.</l><l xml:id="m-7a4bc633-aab9-4289-9457-613029f58407" facs="#m-70fad71c-77a1-42b0-bf26-67d5842de643" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-0e33bf21-51f7-4bef-9dcd-f9af5cf5d65a" facs="#m-6e879d27-ed8f-4bb7-b890-25c44fc24031" label="lyrics-like">«Xáudi nos, Deus, salutáris no-l gaudémus; ita piae devotiónis eru¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e73746a-a0a3-4447-b1e0-99812cfaf9ca" facs="#m-9c5a5937-7d17-41c2-93c7-2cd431f84e47" label="lyrics-like">C ster:*ut sicut de beatae Pu-l diámur afféctu. Per Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-833e7b9e-fd77-4d50-84b7-8dcafd3ac5eb" facs="#m-5c90f7d9-2ff8-4647-8f72-f5e3d5e53b06" label="lyrics-like">dentiánae Virginis tuae festivitâtel strum.</l><l xml:id="m-f8864126-18e8-4ae1-a3ff-0ac1440fae32" facs="#m-8f36a0b1-ed22-4f60-878c-e1efaeadf33d" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Accépta tibi sit. p. 1228, and Postcommunion. Satiásti. p. 1229.</l><l xml:id="m-dbaa8c64-08e2-4c21-b83f-afe054d32487" facs="#m-374c76d3-c334-4abd-9fa5-83378d6a5c32" label="text-like">20. St. Bernardine of Sienna, Confessor. Smi-double.</l><l xml:id="m-fd84b2a4-8ce8-4ccf-a3c3-8d4049e5c84b" facs="#m-93ca77d7-85c3-40ce-a360-a3e3167c1921" label="text-like">Mass. Os justi. p. 1200, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-42394046-b0a2-4e50-bc90-54cd75c9d3f9" facs="#m-44a275fb-55e5-40aa-a546-92ec052a2233" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-037c315f-088d-47a2-82f2-989503291cb1" facs="#m-80ae1ced-114d-4aa6-9937-73bd13791c2c" label="lyrics-like">Omine Jesu, qui beáto Bernar-(intercessióne, * spiritum nobis tuae</l><l xml:id="m-dfa6f20f-10a0-43b8-b310-e67be3850269" facs="#m-561b82bb-f2e8-4938-a961-893e7a3f9d89" label="lyrics-like">U dino Confessóri tuo eximium dilectiónis benignus infúnde: Qui</l><l xml:id="m-9caff7ab-d106-4247-89a6-7ae1f6703533" facs="#m-4e915bc5-841f-447d-8ed1-99a1127ff71b" label="lyrics-like">sancti nóminis tui amórem tribui-lvivis et regnas.</l><l xml:id="m-54a09d2d-92ad-4e57-bfd9-dc47d459dad2" facs="#m-0b937e21-de36-4687-abe8-43b08800708d" label="lyrics-like">sti : ! ejus, quaésumus, méritis et</l><l xml:id="m-17381c8d-88e3-4da2-8e7c-32c037afaba1" facs="#m-65631cb0-500c-46d6-bb60-f16e494b0d6b" label="lyrics-like">Gospel. Ecce nos reliquimus ómnia. p. 1208.</l><l xml:id="m-41527c24-7617-4417-90a5-c7762104ec9b" facs="#m-634317a3-651a-4bf0-bff2-806983f7a257" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Laudis tibi. and Postcommunion. Refécti cibo. p. 1203.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>